From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] FreeChat: erase events locally

Room::erase_events_locally (FFI) and RoomEventCache::erase_events_locally
replace events, and their edits and reactions, by their redacted form in the
event cache, in memory and in the store, without telling the server. Only the
ID, type, sender and time remain; timelines show them as redacted. For
disappearing messages the server has already deleted.
